  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 100eb (Premium)<br>\n<strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 1<br>\n<strong>Fits:</strong> All Ranged Weapons except Bows</p>\n<p>One per weapon; can't be a Popup Weapon. Holds a Gun Shield, which works as a Bulletproof Shield (mods and Tech Upgrades included) only while you hold the weapon two-handed and haven't moved more than 4m/yds on foot this Round. Deploy or retract it as an Action, or while stowing the weapon or setting up a Bipod. Deployed, the weapon can't be concealed. A destroyed Gun Shield is gone for good; fitting a new one takes 1 minute. Shields: Light 50eb (Costly), 5 HP; Medium 100eb (Premium), 10 HP, no Underbarrel attachments except grips; Heavy 250eb (Expensive), 15 HP, no Underbarrel attachments, not on Pistols or SMGs, counts as Thick Cover for Tech Rebuilds.</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Rails &amp; Mounts).</em></p>"
